  "enchanting": {
    "_comment": "Enchanting (docs/draft/enchanting.md). An enchanter NPC (enchant_config) turns a plain ring or necklace into ring-/necklace-<type>-<size>-<quality>-enchanted, which wears jewel-<type>-<size> (and jewel-<type>-tiny too when flawless). Diamonds' effects are per quality from large up (jewel-diamond-<size>-<quality>); alexandrite's per class (jewel-alexandrite-<size>-<class>, from classes). The fee is fees[size] x the enchanter's fee x the quality's fee; the chance is the enchanter's success + the quality's, at most max_success, and a flawless gem never fails. A failure costs the fee and the piece survives. mods are constant modifiers (types.GemEnchant), ticks give 1 hp or mana every so many minutes, and combat_buff rides every fight (the same gem's counts once).",
